WEBVTT

00:02:28.835 --> 00:02:32.274
and tell me that I was unworthy
of their love because I was trans.

00:02:32.811 --> 00:02:34.596
And there's a culture of lovelessness

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.752
that we've created around
transgender people.

00:02:36.776 --> 00:02:39.728
It's reasoned, justified
and often signed into law.

00:02:39.752 --> 00:02:42.767
And I was a heartbeat away
from internalizing that message,

00:02:42.791 --> 00:02:44.333
that I wasn't worthy.

00:02:44.357 --> 00:02:46.125
But Kim said that I was her ideal --

00:02:46.149 --> 00:02:47.754
the heartbroken mess that I was.

00:02:47.778 --> 00:02:48.928
(Laughter)

00:02:49.349 --> 00:02:51.006
KKM: He totally was my ideal.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:52.142
(Laughter)

00:02:52.166 --> 00:02:53.490
In more ways than one.

00:02:53.869 --> 00:02:56.246
Both poets, writers, creatives

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.751
with a long history
of community work behind us,

00:02:58.775 --> 00:03:01.573
and big, huge dreams
of a family in front of us,